    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the mysterious world of the Backrooms!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie locations, solve puzzles, and immerse yourself in a calm, meditative journey. <strong>Backrooms New Gate</strong> is an atmospheric adventure where you can freely explore, uncover hidden stories, and lose yourself in the enigmatic environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POOL ROOMS \u2013 THE WATERY DEPTHS OF THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly half of the game is dedicated to Pool Rooms \u2013 vast flooded halls, corridors, and hidden underwater structures. Walk through these surreal spaces, uncover their mysteries, and even dive beneath the surface to explore breathtaking underwater landscapes and secret paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, INTERACT, SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms New Gate offers an interactive world: read notes, activate mechanisms, unlock hidden passages, and piece together the stories left behind by those who came before you. There\u2019s no rush, no pressure \u2013 just you, a mysterious world, and its waiting secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A RELAXING ATMOSPHERE WITH LIGHT MOMENTS OF TENSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the journey is peaceful and meditative. However, at times, the atmosphere subtly shifts, creating brief moments of unease. No stressful chases, no overwhelming dangers \u2013 just gentle surprises that add to the intrigue of your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE SECRETS OF THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past lingers in letters, audio recordings, and diaries scattered throughout the world. Find them, piece together the fragments, and discover the truth behind this strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms New Gate</strong> isn\u2019t just a game \u2013 it\u2019s a journey where you decide how to explore. Meditative walks, engaging puzzles, a mystical atmosphere, and endless Pool Rooms await you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive into the mysterious world of the Backrooms!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/e3c7b4073bc6ecf5f00f87b09e78b773.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie locations, solve puzzles, and immerse yourself in a calm, meditative journey. <strong>Backrooms New Gate</strong> is an atmospheric adventure where you can freely explore, uncover hidden stories, and lose yourself in the enigmatic environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POOL ROOMS \u2013 THE WATERY DEPTHS OF THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/b1675903b272d163ad8934400cff4dca.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly half of the game is dedicated to Pool Rooms \u2013 vast flooded halls, corridors, and hidden underwater structures. Walk through these surreal spaces, uncover their mysteries, and even dive beneath the surface to explore breathtaking underwater landscapes and secret paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE, INTERACT, SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms New Gate offers an interactive world: read notes, activate mechanisms, unlock hidden passages, and piece together the stories left behind by those who came before you. There\u2019s no rush, no pressure \u2013 just you, a mysterious world, and its waiting secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A RELAXING ATMOSPHERE WITH LIGHT MOMENTS OF TENSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.poster.avif?t=1745307739\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.webm?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/extras/5463942fcfe78e4984c2e90064e97e49.mp4?t=1745307739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the journey is peaceful and meditative. However, at times, the atmosphere subtly shifts, creating brief moments of unease. No stressful chases, no overwhelming dangers \u2013 just gentle surprises that add to the intrigue of your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE SECRETS OF THE BACKROOMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The past lingers in letters, audio recordings, and diaries scattered throughout the world. Find them, piece together the fragments, and discover the truth behind this strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms New Gate</strong> isn\u2019t just a game \u2013 it\u2019s a journey where you decide how to explore. Meditative walks, engaging puzzles, a mystical atmosphere, and endless Pool Rooms await you.</p>",
